{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53567","headline":"崔徽歌 二 · 元稹","name":"崔徽歌 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有客有客名丘夏，善写仪容得艳姿。\n爲徽持此寄敬中，以死报郎爲终始。\n（以上见《绿窗新话》卷上）（按：《全唐诗》卷四二三收以上二节，有缺误，又误连作一首，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53567.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53567","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}